    { "id": "title", "type": "text", "x": 100, "y": 30, "width": 1380, "height": 36, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 401, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 27, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "F2 serving migration (off Cloudflare/Google, before pretest): which Elestio home?", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "F2 serving migration (off Cloudflare/Google, before pretest): which Elestio home?", "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 24 },
    { "id": "context", "type": "text", "x": 100, "y": 74, "width": 1380, "height": 42, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 402, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "RESOLVED: the CSWeb box (csweb.asiansocial.org) IS an Elestio-managed VM — 'our prod server' and 'the Elestio end-state' are one place. TIMING SUPERPOWER: pre-pretest\nis greenfield (only UAT testers enrolled, ~zero real data) → origin change ≈ free, store cutover needs no dual-write. After fielding starts, both become 10× harder.", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "RESOLVED: the CSWeb box (csweb.asiansocial.org) IS an Elestio-managed VM — 'our prod server' and 'the Elestio end-state' are one place. TIMING SUPERPOWER: pre-pretest is greenfield (only UAT testers enrolled, ~zero real data) → origin change ≈ free, store cutover needs no dual-write. After fielding starts, both become 10× harder.", "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 35 },

    { "id": "today_label", "type": "text", "x": 100, "y": 134, "width": 400, "height": 22, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 410, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "WHAT MUST MOVE (today's stack)", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "WHAT MUST MOVE (today's stack)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 15 },

    { "id": "t_box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 100, "y": 164, "width": 1380, "height": 118, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "#eff6ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": { "type": 3 }, "seed": 411, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false },
    { "id": "t_txt", "type": "text", "x": 116, "y": 174, "width": 1348, "height": 98, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 412, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "text": "CF Pages (f2-pwa.pages.dev)     → static PWA hosting            | CF Worker                     → JWT proxy · /verify-token · admin API · cron digests\nCF KV (F2_AUTH)                 → token revocation·audit·sessions | CF R2 (f2-admin)              → admin file uploads · break-out CSVs\nGoogle Apps Script + Sheet      → write path + store (18-col F2_Responses · F2_HCWs registry · config)\nALREADY ON OUR BOX: csweb_f2 MySQL mirror (41 subs, qn col, 2-min poller) · unified dashboard · nginx serving /docs · Elestio TLS/certs · GH-Actions CI", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "CF Pages (f2-pwa.pages.dev)     → static PWA hosting            | CF Worker                     → JWT proxy · /verify-token · admin API · cron digests\nCF KV (F2_AUTH)                 → token revocation·audit·sessions | CF R2 (f2-admin)              → admin file uploads · break-out CSVs\nGoogle Apps Script + Sheet      → write path + store (18-col F2_Responses · F2_HCWs registry · config)\nALREADY ON OUR BOX: csweb_f2 MySQL mirror (41 subs, qn col, 2-min poller) · unified dashboard · nginx serving /docs · Elestio TLS/certs · GH-Actions CI", "lineHeight": 1.55, "baseline": 90 },

    { "id": "divider1", "type": "line", "x": 100, "y": 306, "width": 1380, "height": 0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 420, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [1380, 0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": null },

    { "id": "a_title", "type": "text", "x": 100, "y": 328, "width": 640, "height": 44, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#047857", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 430, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "OPTION A  ★ RECOMMENDED — Consolidate on the existing\ncsweb Elestio box (one server runs the whole survey)", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "OPTION A  ★ RECOMMENDED — Consolidate on the existing csweb Elestio box (one server runs the whole survey)", "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 39 },
    { "id": "a_mock", "type": "rectangle", "x": 100, "y": 384, "width": 640, "height": 148, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#047857", "backgroundColor": "#a7f3d0", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": { "type": 3 }, "seed": 431, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false },
    { "id": "a_mock_t", "type": "text", "x": 114, "y": 394, "width": 612, "height": 128, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#065f46", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 432, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 12.5, "fontFamily": 3, "text": "uhc-hcw.asiansocial.org  (elestio-nginx vhost + auto-TLS)\n ├─ /            static PWA build   (rsync from CI, like /docs)\n ├─ /api  →  f2-api container (Node/Hono) in the SAME compose\n │    JWT auth · /verify-token · submit · admin API · QN assign\n │    KV→MySQL tables (csweb_f2.auth_*) · R2→/opt/app/f2-files\n └─ store: csweb_f2 MySQL = THE store (poller/Sheet retired)\nRAM: +~150-250MB on 1.4GB free · $0 new infra", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "uhc-hcw.asiansocial.org  (elestio-nginx vhost + auto-TLS)\n ├─ /            static PWA build   (rsync from CI, like /docs)\n ├─ /api  →  f2-api container (Node/Hono) in the SAME compose\n │    JWT auth · /verify-token · submit · admin API · QN assign\n │    KV→MySQL tables (csweb_f2.auth_*) · R2→/opt/app/f2-files\n └─ store: csweb_f2 MySQL = THE store (poller/Sheet retired)\nRAM: +~150-250MB on 1.4GB free · $0 new infra", "lineHeight": 1.5, "baseline": 121 },
    { "id": "a_bullets", "type": "text", "x": 100, "y": 546, "width": 650, "height": 140, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 433, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "✓ csweb_f2 is ALREADY the store-in-waiting (live, qn-ready, reviewed) —\n   the API writes it directly; dashboard reads stay native, poller retires\n✓ $0/mo extra · one ops surface · one backup (borg already on-box)\n✓ Elestio manages TLS/monitoring/restarts we already trust for CSWeb\n✗ Shared blast radius with the F1/F3/F4 CSWeb sync — managed by\n   container isolation + mem_limit + nginx vhost separation\n○ Load is modest by design: self-administered HCWs, ~10³ over months", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "✓ csweb_f2 is ALREADY the store-in-waiting (live, qn-ready, reviewed) —\n   the API writes it directly; dashboard reads stay native, poller retires\n✓ $0/mo extra · one ops surface · one backup (borg already on-box)\n✓ Elestio manages TLS/monitoring/restarts we already trust for CSWeb\n✗ Shared blast radius with the F1/F3/F4 CSWeb sync — managed by\n   container isolation + mem_limit + nginx vhost separation\n○ Load is modest by design: self-administered HCWs, ~10³ over months", "lineHeight": 1.4, "baseline": 133 },

    { "id": "b_title", "type": "text", "x": 800, "y": 328, "width": 640, "height": 44, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b45309", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 440, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "OPTION B — Dedicated second Elestio service for F2\n(full isolation, own VM)", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "OPTION B — Dedicated second Elestio service for F2 (full isolation, own VM)", "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 39 },
    { "id": "b_mock", "type": "rectangle", "x": 800, "y": 384, "width": 640, "height": 148, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b45309", "backgroundColor": "#fef3c7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": { "type": 3 }, "seed": 441, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false },
    { "id": "b_mock_t", "type": "text", "x": 814, "y": 394, "width": 612, "height": 128, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#78350f", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 442, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 12.5, "fontFamily": 3, "text": "uhc-hcw.asiansocial.org → NEW Elestio service (own VM)\n ├─ static PWA + f2-api (Node/Hono) + own MySQL/Postgres\n ├─ own TLS · own backups · own monitoring · own .env\n └─ csweb dashboard reads F2 CROSS-HOST →\n     the mirror poller SURVIVES (new-box → csweb_f2)\nNEW: ~$15-30+/mo · provisioning · second ops surface\nDNS + firewall + secrets duplicated", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "uhc-hcw.asiansocial.org → NEW Elestio service (own VM)\n ├─ static PWA + f2-api (Node/Hono) + own MySQL/Postgres\n ├─ own TLS · own backups · own monitoring · own .env\n └─ csweb dashboard reads F2 CROSS-HOST →\n     the mirror poller SURVIVES (new-box → csweb_f2)\nNEW: ~$15-30+/mo · provisioning · second ops surface\nDNS + firewall + secrets duplicated", "lineHeight": 1.5, "baseline": 121 },
    { "id": "b_bullets", "type": "text", "x": 800, "y": 546, "width": 660, "height": 140, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 443, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "✓ Full isolation — an F2 incident can never touch the CSWeb sync\n✓ Independent scaling if F2 load surprises us\n✗ New monthly cost + provisioning + hardening during the tightest\n   window (pretest imminent)\n✗ The dashboard's F2 read goes CROSS-HOST — keeps the poller/mirror\n   machinery alive forever instead of retiring it\n✗ Two servers to patch, back up, monitor, and secret-manage", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "✓ Full isolation — an F2 incident can never touch the CSWeb sync\n✓ Independent scaling if F2 load surprises us\n✗ New monthly cost + provisioning + hardening during the tightest\n   window (pretest imminent)\n✗ The dashboard's F2 read goes CROSS-HOST — keeps the poller/mirror\n   machinery alive forever instead of retiring it\n✗ Two servers to patch, back up, monitor, and secret-manage", "lineHeight": 1.4, "baseline": 133 },

    { "id": "rec_box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 100, "y": 706, "width": 1380, "height": 106, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#047857", "backgroundColor": "#a7f3d0", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": { "type": 3 }, "seed": 450, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false },
    { "id": "rec_t", "type": "text", "x": 120, "y": 720, "width": 1340, "height": 78, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#065f46", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 451, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 14.5, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "RECOMMENDATION — Option A. The store is already there and battle-reviewed (csweb_f2 + qn), the box is already Elestio-managed with headroom, the load is\nself-administered-modest, and pre-pretest greenfield means the whole cutover is: stand up the f2-api container → point the app at uhc-hcw.asiansocial.org →\nre-enroll the UAT testers → retire Cloudflare/Google to dark fallback. Option B stays the documented escape hatch if F2 load ever threatens the CSWeb sync.\nEither way the migration plan phases are identical — only the target host differs.", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "RECOMMENDATION — Option A. The store is already there and battle-reviewed (csweb_f2 + qn), the box is already Elestio-managed with headroom, the load is self-administered-modest, and pre-pretest greenfield means the whole cutover is: stand up the f2-api container → point the app at uhc-hcw.asiansocial.org → re-enroll the UAT testers → retire Cloudflare/Google to dark fallback. Option B stays the documented escape hatch if F2 load ever threatens the CSWeb sync. Either way the migration plan phases are identical — only the target host differs.", "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 71 }
  ],
